  {
   "title": "SWD",
   "sections": [
    {
     "title": "SWD 参数",
     "subtitle": "请求 / 响应 / 周转 / 校验。字节按十六进制输入，地址用 0x 前缀。修改参数后点“仿真”。",
     "span": 5,
     "widgets": [
      {
       "type": "number",
       "id": "swd_frequency",
       "label": "时钟频率",
       "value": 1000000,
       "min": 1,
       "max": 1000000000,
       "unit": "Hz",
       "decimals": 0
      },
      {
       "type": "combo",
       "id": "swd_operation",
       "label": "操作",
       "options": [
        "read",
        "write"
       ],
       "value": "read"
      },
      {
       "type": "combo",
       "id": "swd_ap",
       "label": "APnDP",
       "options": [
        0,
        1
       ],
       "value": 0
      },
      {
       "type": "combo",
       "id": "swd_address",
       "label": "寄存器地址",
       "options": [
        0,
        4,
        8,
        12
       ],
       "value": 0
      },
      {
       "type": "text",
       "id": "swd_value",
       "label": "32 位数据",
       "value": "0x2BA01477",
       "mono": true
      },
      {
       "type": "combo",
       "id": "swd_ack",
       "label": "ACK",
       "options": [
        "OK",
        "WAIT",
        "FAULT"
       ],
       "value": "OK"
      },
      {
       "type": "combo",
       "id": "swd_line_reset",
       "label": "线路复位",
       "options": [
        1,
        0
       ],
       "value": 1
      },
      {
       "type": "combo",
       "id": "swd_parity_error",
       "label": "校验错误",
       "options": [
        0,
        1
       ],
       "value": 0
      },
      {
       "type": "button",
       "id": "swd_simulate",
       "label": "仿真",
       "style": "primary",
       "fit": true,
       "action": {
        "method": "simulate",
        "args": {
         "protocol": "SWD",
         "frequency": "$form.swd_frequency",
         "options": {
          "operation": "$form.swd_operation",
          "ap": "$form.swd_ap",
          "address": "$form.swd_address",
          "value": "$form.swd_value",
          "ack": "$form.swd_ack",
          "line_reset": "$form.swd_line_reset",
          "parity_error": "$form.swd_parity_error"
         }
        }
       },
       "publish": "swd_capture"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "仿真信息",
     "subtitle": "单次 DP/AP 传输；从 SWD 模式开始，不含 JTAG 切换及 AP posted-read 管线。HOST_OE 区分主机驱动/释放，TURN 显示为虚线。",
     "span": 7,
     "widgets": [
      {
       "type": "readout",
       "source": "swd_capture",
       "field": "duration",
       "label": "总时长",
       "unit": "s"
      },
      {
       "type": "readout",
       "source": "swd_capture",
       "field": "event_count",
       "label": "解码字段"
      },
      {
       "type": "readout",
       "source": "swd_capture",
       "field": "error_count",
       "label": "异常字段"
      },
      {
       "type": "readout",
       "source": "swd_capture",
       "field": "description",
       "label": "模型范围"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "时序与协议解码",
     "span": 12,
     "subtitle": "滚轮缩放，左键框选，右键拖动平移，双击显示全部。顶部标尺左/右键放置 C1/C2，悬停字段查看详情。",
     "widgets": [
      {
       "type": "logic",
       "source": "swd_capture",
       "legend": "小三角仅标记当前协议配置的有效采样沿，无边沿文字；悬停查看时刻。方框为协议字段，红色为异常。SPI/UART/I²C/SWD 显示位名=值、位边界和三角形采样点。PCIe 页为 TLP 事务接口示意。"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "字段记录",
     "span": 12,
     "widgets": [
      {
       "type": "table",
       "source": "swd_capture",
       "rows_field": "rows",
       "columns": [
        {
         "field": "time",
         "label": "开始",
         "unit": "s"
        },
        {
         "field": "duration",
         "label": "持续",
         "unit": "s"
        },
        {
         "field": "channel",
         "label": "通道"
        },
        {
         "field": "label",
         "label": "字段"
        },
        {
         "field": "status",
         "label": "状态",
         "tones": {
          "error": "error"
         }
        },
        {
         "field": "detail",
         "label": "内容 / 方向"
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "导出本次仿真",
     "span": 12,
     "subtitle": "VCD 可供 GTKWave 等波形工具读取，JSON 保留参数、波形和解码。目标文件须不存在；PCIe 包字段保存在 JSON 中。",
     "widgets": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "id": "swd_export_path",
       "label": "文件路径",
       "value": "",
       "mono": true
      },
      {
       "type": "combo",
       "id": "swd_format",
       "label": "格式",
       "options": [
        "vcd",
        "json"
       ],
       "value": "vcd"
      },
      {
       "type": "button",
       "label": "导出",
       "fit": true,
       "style": "secondary",
       "action": {
        "method": "export",
        "args": {
         "protocol": "SWD",
         "path": "$form.swd_export_path",
         "format": "$form.swd_format"
        }
       },
       "publish": "swd_export"
      },
      {
       "type": "readout",
       "label": "已导出",
       "source": "swd_export",
       "field": "path"
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
